@1    = ~Greetings, which deed brings you to our city?~
@2    = ~Mind your own business!~
@3    = ~I have scores to settle.~
@4    = ~What silly question, the adventure obviously...~
@5    = ~Your face looks familiar, are you wanted or something?~
@6    = ~Me wanted, ha ha, no of course... Well, have a nice day.~
@7    = ~I'm watching you citizens !~
@8    = ~If you have a conflict to resolve, ask the garrison commander in the basement of the Ducal Palace.~
@9    = ~No fights, got it. Do you have any other information about the city's affairs?~
@10   = ~Don't be so flammable, it's time for me to go. Goodbye.~
@11   = ~If you have a conflict to resolve, ask the commander, its garrison was installed in a house just outside the palace.~
@12   = ~If you're seeking adventure, Elorin, the magician recently installed in the tower of Ramazith, is constantly asking to the Flaming Fist about a quest of great importance... At least for him...~
@13   = ~I'll meet this magician as soon as possible. Do you have any other information on city affairs?~
@14   = ~And you're back, do you need anything?~
@15   = ~Do you have any other information on city affairs?~
